00:11:58.769 --> 00:11:59.769
It was all-male.

00:11:59.769 --> 00:12:00.769
That didn't seem fair to him.

00:12:00.769 --> 00:12:01.769
Why shouldn't women get to fight too?

00:12:01.769 --> 00:12:02.769
He was nothing if not a feminist - Hell, thanks
to his body-swapping necklace, he’d actually

00:12:02.769 --> 00:12:03.769
been a woman many times.

00:12:03.769 --> 00:12:04.769
So, he decided to seek out a few more female
anomalies to recruit.

00:12:04.769 --> 00:12:06.381
Next, Dr. Bright plugged his nose to avoid
the swampy smell of SCP-811's enclosure, where

00:12:06.381 --> 00:12:08.709
she lounged in the water, humming a little
song to herself.

00:12:08.709 --> 00:12:13.850
She was more than happy to come with Dr. Bright,
especially when he offered her a tasty snack

00:12:13.850 --> 00:12:16.089
in the form of a whole live chicken.

00:12:16.089 --> 00:12:19.860
She was a very food-motivated gal, and he
could respect that.

00:12:19.860 --> 00:12:23.790
He knew he would get in trouble for this next
pick in his lineup, but Dr. Bright couldn't

00:12:23.790 --> 00:12:29.379
resist bringing SCP-029, the Daughter of Shadows,
into the fold.

00:12:29.379 --> 00:12:34.079
Notable for her extreme hostility and penchant
for strangling people to death, he couldn't

00:12:34.079 --> 00:12:37.709
wait to watch her in action up against some
of his other members.

00:12:37.709 --> 00:12:42.149
Dr. Bright was finally ready to put his Fight
Club into action, and he herded his merry

00:12:42.149 --> 00:12:45.519
band of miscreants toward the break room to
get started.

00:12:45.519 --> 00:12:47.939
But wait...he was forgetting something.

00:12:47.939 --> 00:12:49.489
How could he have been so foolish?!

00:12:49.489 --> 00:12:50.639
They would be perfect!

00:12:50.639 --> 00:12:55.759
Quickly, he sprinted over to SCP-056's containment
room, and opened the door.

00:12:55.759 --> 00:13:00.149
He already knew what form it would take on
before he even saw it, but still he was delighted

00:13:00.149 --> 00:13:02.509
at the vision that awaited him inside.

00:13:02.509 --> 00:13:08.839
SCP-056 had transformed into the shape of
Brad Pitt as Tyler Durden in the movie Fight

00:13:08.839 --> 00:13:09.839
Club.

00:13:09.839 --> 00:13:12.490
A perfect, handsome fighting specimen, ready
for action.

00:13:12.490 --> 00:13:14.269
"Would you do me the honor of joining my--"

00:13:14.269 --> 00:13:16.370
"Of course, you pathetic little worm."

00:13:16.370 --> 00:13:19.949
SCP-056 didn't let Dr. Bright even finish
his question.

00:13:19.949 --> 00:13:21.440
"This is my time to shine.

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:22.440
Out of my way."

00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:26.689
It swept past him and out the door, walking
toward the break room with the confidence

00:13:26.689 --> 00:13:27.949
of a champion.

00:13:27.949 --> 00:13:29.869
Finally, it was time.

00:13:29.869 --> 00:13:33.999
Dr. Bright dimmed the lights in the break
room, moved all furniture off of the floor,

00:13:33.999 --> 00:13:36.519
and prepared for the bloodshed to begin.

00:13:36.519 --> 00:13:41.049
He clapped his hands together delightedly,
taking in the sight of his brand new, completely

00:13:41.049 --> 00:13:44.429
perfect, Unofficial SCP Foundation Fight Club.

00:13:44.429 --> 00:13:45.869
"Listen up, everyone!"

00:13:45.869 --> 00:13:46.869
He began.

00:13:46.869 --> 00:13:49.470
"The rules: Don't talk about Bright Club.

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:54.100
No weapons, just fists- or whatever limbs
you might have, if you don't have hands.

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:56.910
If your opponent taps out or goes limp, the
fight is over.

00:13:56.910 --> 00:14:00.639
And if it's your first night here, which is
the case for literally everyone in the room

00:14:00.639 --> 00:14:01.639
right now?

00:14:01.639 --> 00:14:02.639
You have to fight.

00:14:02.639 --> 00:14:04.180
Okay, who's up first?"

00:14:04.180 --> 00:14:07.899
Before he could so much as select a pair of
fighters to step into the center of the room,

00:14:07.899 --> 00:14:13.889
the Polymorphic Humanoid was lunging at SCP-056
with a shriek, fangs bared and claws out.

00:14:13.889 --> 00:14:18.399
She struck the beautiful figure, still in
the shape of 1990s Brad Pitt, and though the

00:14:18.399 --> 00:14:22.569
Beautiful Person held their own, they were
unable to stop the fox woman from beating

00:14:22.569 --> 00:14:24.559
the living hell out of their face.

00:14:24.559 --> 00:14:26.439
"I've had enough of this!"

00:14:26.439 --> 00:14:31.120
SCP-056 stumbled to their feet, gave a haughty
huff, and ran from the room.

00:14:31.120 --> 00:14:34.639
The Polymorphic Humanoid wiped some blood
from her beautiful face, and, feeling the

00:14:34.639 --> 00:14:36.470
eyes of the room on her, shrugged.

00:14:36.470 --> 00:14:39.259
"I felt like destroying something beautiful."

00:14:39.259 --> 00:14:40.259
"Okay..."

00:14:40.259 --> 00:14:42.149
Dr. Bright laughed nervously.

00:14:42.149 --> 00:14:43.879
"Who's up next?"

00:14:43.879 --> 00:14:48.339
The Daughter of Shadows was already strangling
Cactusman, who was fighting back by poking

00:14:48.339 --> 00:14:49.959
her with his spikes defensively.

00:14:49.959 --> 00:14:54.209
"Okay, that's not really...in the spirit of
the game...a little help here?"

00:14:54.209 --> 00:14:57.850
He looked over to God, who snapped his fingers
and teleported the two offending fighters

00:14:57.850 --> 00:15:00.299
back to their respective containment cells.

00:15:00.299 --> 00:15:04.350
In spite of his best efforts, this was not
quite going to plan.

00:15:04.350 --> 00:15:07.250
Who would have thought that putting a bunch
of anomalous creatures in a room together

00:15:07.250 --> 00:15:10.579
and telling them to fight would be a bad idea?

00:15:10.579 --> 00:15:12.379
Absolutely no one could have foreseen this.

00:15:12.379 --> 00:15:13.379
"Tally ho!

00:15:13.379 --> 00:15:16.549
Who is up for a round in the ring with Lord
Theodore Blackwood?!"

00:15:16.549 --> 00:15:19.910
The slug slid into the center of the room,
waiting for a worthy opponent.

00:15:19.910 --> 00:15:21.660
Silence fell over the room.

00:15:21.660 --> 00:15:25.699
No one seemed interested in facing off against
such a diminutive fighter.

00:15:25.699 --> 00:15:28.050
"Come on now, get your dukes up old chaps!"

00:15:28.050 --> 00:15:32.269
The Swamp Woman licked her lips, salivating
a bit at the sight of the slug, but no one

00:15:32.269 --> 00:15:34.109
made a move to engage him.

00:15:34.109 --> 00:15:38.879
Dr. Bright had to do something, anything,
to get the energy back in the room.

00:15:38.879 --> 00:15:44.389
In a stroke of inspiration, he shoved SCP-2430,
the Immortal Hitler Clone, into the center

00:15:44.389 --> 00:15:45.389
of the room.

00:15:45.389 --> 00:15:46.779
"Who wants to hit this guy, huh?"

00:15:46.779 --> 00:15:50.730
Immediately, every anomaly in the room descended
on the man, punching and hitting his mustached

00:15:50.730 --> 00:15:52.769
face with everything they had.

00:15:52.769 --> 00:15:54.529
Now this was more like it!

00:15:54.529 --> 00:15:58.730
"I did say the fights should be one on one
but what the hell, this is great!"

00:15:58.730 --> 00:16:02.660
Suddenly, the door to the break room flew
off its hinges with a crash as someone kicked

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:03.660
it open.

00:16:03.660 --> 00:16:04.660
"What is this?!"

00:16:04.660 --> 00:16:05.709
A voice boomed.

00:16:05.709 --> 00:16:12.139
Dr. Bright turned, and his stomach dropped
at the sight of SCP-076-2, Able, entered the

00:16:12.139 --> 00:16:14.389
room, wearing a menacing scowl.

00:16:14.389 --> 00:16:17.489
"Engaging in acts of brutality without me?

00:16:17.489 --> 00:16:18.489
Fighting?

00:16:18.489 --> 00:16:19.579
Without me?!"

00:16:19.579 --> 00:16:23.689
He turned his steely gaze onto the Doctor,
who swallowed a lump of pure terror in his

00:16:23.689 --> 00:16:24.689
throat.

00:16:24.689 --> 00:16:29.319
He hadn't seen Able much since, well...He
reflexively covered the amulet around his

00:16:29.319 --> 00:16:33.660
neck, thinking of the fateful day that his
consciousness was sealed inside and his old

00:16:33.660 --> 00:16:35.329
body was destroyed.

00:16:35.329 --> 00:16:38.029
Able brandished his bladed weapon with a bellowing
war cry.

00:16:38.029 --> 00:16:40.730
"I have come to fight you all!"

00:16:40.730 --> 00:16:44.040
"Um, actually, it's a no weapons situation
in here..."

00:16:44.040 --> 00:16:47.239
Dr. Bright started to say, but one look from
Able shut him up.

00:16:47.239 --> 00:16:50.049
"Never mind, it's fine, do your thing."

00:16:50.049 --> 00:16:54.889
Able began swinging his blade wildly, slicing
massive gashes into the walls of the room

00:16:54.889 --> 00:16:57.579
and chopping the microwave clean in half.

00:16:57.579 --> 00:17:00.609
Watching the chaos unfold before him, God
rubbed his chin thoughtfully.

00:17:00.609 --> 00:17:01.609
"Hm.

00:17:01.609 --> 00:17:03.920
This doesn't seem great," he remarked.

00:17:03.920 --> 00:17:09.419
The entire room was a blur of motion, of screams
and growls and grunts of effort as everyone

00:17:09.419 --> 00:17:13.630
inside descended into a flurry of uncontrollable
violence.

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:18.850
Able cackled wildly as he chopped off Pesterbot's
head, holding it up above him in a show of

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:19.929
vicious glee.

00:17:19.929 --> 00:17:24.589
Dr. Bright collapsed to his knees as he watched
it all, powerless to stop a thing.

00:17:24.589 --> 00:17:28.230
How was he supposed to know that starting
a Fight Club would lead to an all-out whirlwind

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:32.630
of unstoppable discord and violence, that
he was creating a monster he could never hope

00:17:32.630 --> 00:17:33.790
to quell?!

00:17:33.790 --> 00:17:35.620
It's not like this happened in the movie!

00:17:35.620 --> 00:17:38.580
This whole project had ended in absolute mayhem!

00:17:38.580 --> 00:17:43.090
Suddenly the chaos was broken up, as a group
of armored Mobile Task Force operatives rushed

00:17:43.090 --> 00:17:47.770
into the room, pulling everyone apart and
dragging them back to their respective containment

00:17:47.770 --> 00:17:48.770
cells.

00:17:48.770 --> 00:17:52.990
He recognized their uniforms as belonging
to members of the elite Mobile Task Force:

00:17:52.990 --> 00:17:54.529
The Red Right Hand.

00:17:54.529 --> 00:18:00.450
They cuffed Dr. Bright - the indignity!- and
brought him before the O5 council for judgment.

00:18:00.450 --> 00:18:05.630
"You absolute cretin, you tiny-minded little
imbecile..."

00:18:05.630 --> 00:18:06.840
O5-1 sneered.

00:18:06.840 --> 00:18:10.080
"I'd ask what you were thinking, but I already
know the answer: you weren't."

00:18:10.080 --> 00:18:12.070
"What are you going to do to me?"

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:14.460
Dr. Bright cowered before the power of the
council.

00:18:14.460 --> 00:18:17.159
"Something that truly fits the crime."

00:18:17.159 --> 00:18:18.610
O1 smirked.

00:18:18.610 --> 00:18:23.860
"Your movie privileges have been officially
revoked, until further notice."

00:18:23.860 --> 00:18:28.830
Now go check out “SCP Edition - Weirdest
Things on Amazon - Dr Bright's Great Idea!”

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:32.669
and “HILARIOUS List of Things Dr. Bright
is Not Allowed to Do!” for more wacky and

00:18:32.669 --> 00:18:35.049
wonderful incidents from Dr. Bright!

